# Smart Notes Ultra V3

Smart Notes Ultra adalah aplikasi notes desktop modern menggunakan Python & PyQt5.

---

# ✨ Features

* 📝 Multi Notes System
* 📌 Pin Notes
* 🔍 Search Notes
* 💾 Auto Save
* 🔒 Password Lock
* 🎨 Multiple Themes
* 📋 Copy & Paste
* ✅ Todo Checklist
* ✏ Rich Text Editor
* 📊 Word Counter
* 📅 Date Insert
* ⌨ Keyboard Shortcuts
* 📂 Multi Tabs

---

# ⌨ Shortcuts

| Shortcut         | Function    |
| ---------------- | ----------- |
| Ctrl + S         | Save Note   |
| Ctrl + N         | New Note    |
| Ctrl + D         | Delete Note |
| Ctrl + L         | Lock Notes  |
| Ctrl + P         | Pin Note    |
| Ctrl + F         | Search      |
| Ctrl + B         | Bold        |
| Ctrl + I         | Italic      |
| Ctrl + U         | Underline   |
| Ctrl + Shift + C | Copy        |
| Ctrl + Shift + V | Paste       |
| Ctrl + Tab       | Next Tab    |

---

# 🛠 Made With

* Python
* PyQt5
* JSON Storage

